@startuml SD05_SlewAndFallback
!include _style.iuml
title SD-05  Mount slewing, parked or disconnected; ROI outside the working area (UC-07) — REQ-05, REQ-07, REQ-25 … REQ-27, REQ-58

participant "ITelescopeMediator" as TM
participant ":NinaMountStateSource" as Mount
participant ":MountWatcher" as MW
participant ":MonitorService" as Svc
participant ":MonitoringCycle" as Cyc
participant ":RoiCalculator" as Roi
participant ":RoiBuilder" as RB
participant ":WorkingArea" as WA
participant ":SafetyDecisionEngine" as Eng
participant ":SlewHoldPolicy" as Hold

== Every 2 s (MountWatcher) ==
MW -> Mount : GetCurrent()
Mount -> TM : GetInfo()
TM --> Mount : TelescopeInfo
Mount --> MW : MountState
alt slew started/ended, park, tracking, connect, move > 0.5°
  MW -> Svc : Changed → RequestEvaluation()
  note right of Svc : "Mount changed (slewing): re-evaluating now".\nThe next cycle runs at once and reuses the\nlatest image (fetched once per image interval).
end

== Slewing to a new target ==
Svc -> Cyc : RunOnceAsync()
Cyc -> Mount : GetCurrent()
Mount --> Cyc : MountState(Slewing = true)
Cyc --> Svc : snapshot(Mount = slewing)
Svc -> Eng : Decide(snapshot)
Eng -> Hold : ShouldHold(mount)
Hold --> Eng : true
Eng --> Svc : last decision, reason "Mount slewing: holding last decision (…)"\n(Unsafe "Mount slewing" if none yet; clear-period timer unchanged)  REQ-27

== Tracking a target (slew finished → re-evaluated at once) ==
Cyc -> Roi : CalculateCentre(mount, site, now)
Roi --> Cyc : centre from RA/Dec (mount Alt/Az not used)
Cyc -> RB : Build(centre, null, 15°, 0.5, area)
RB -> WA : Contains(point) for 400 points over the circle
alt at least 50% of the circle inside the working area
  RB --> Cyc : ROI = circle within the working area  (REQ-25)
else less than 50% inside (low target, behind trees)
  RB --> Cyc : ROI = whole working area,\nNote "ROI 20% inside the working area: judging the whole working area"  (REQ-58)
end

== Parked / not tracking / disconnected ==
Cyc -> Roi : CalculateCentre(mount, site, now)
Roi --> Cyc : (null, "Mount parked")
Cyc -> RB : Build(null, "Mount parked", …)
RB --> Cyc : ROI = whole working area,\nNote "Mount parked: judging the whole working area"  (REQ-26)
@enduml
